{"id":"155f29c77793ff50","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-kripke-platek-theories.md","title":"无无穷公理的 KP 与含无穷的 KPω","display":"df-kripke-platek-theories — 无无穷公理的 KP 与含无穷的 KPω","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-kripke-platek-theories","aliases":["72-df-kripke-platek-theories"],"display":"df-kripke-platek-theories — 无无穷公理的 KP 与含无穷的 KPω","depends_on":["[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2 axioms KP−, KP, KPω, print216–217/PDF228–229","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source axiom roles, universal closure and freshness checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"在 KP 公理集合内绑定全部模板变量并列出新鲜性过滤，排除自由参数"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-kripke-platek-theories"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-kripke-platek-theories</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kripke-platek-theories — 无无穷公理的 KP 与含无穷的 KPω"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2 axioms KP−, KP, KPω, print216–217/PDF228–229"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source axiom roles, universal closure and freshness checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"在 KP 公理集合内绑定全部模板变量并列出新鲜性过滤，排除自由参数"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\in,\\Delta^s_0,\\operatorname{av}_s\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\in,\\Delta^s_0,\\operatorname{av}_s\\)</span>、部分自由代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"676fecd09411613c\" href=\"?note=676fecd09411613c\" title=\"72-df-set-theory-syntax\">72-df-set-theory-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\">\\((A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)\\)</span> 按其有限自由变量指标递增作全称闭包。</li>\n<li>Sep 输入要求 a、z 互异且都不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>；Col 要求 x≠y 且 a、b 互异并避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x,y\\}\\)</span>；Fnd 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>。这些变量遍历全部合法选择，形成公理集合；不指定单值的隐含新鲜变量选择。</li>\n<li>Ext、Found、Pair、Union、Inf 式中的 u,v,w,x,y,z,e 均为互异变量。下式的量词均为集合论对象语言的有限树构造；集合并在元语言中。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\\quad\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&amp;:=\\forall u\\forall v\\bigl[(\\forall x(x\\in_s u\\leftrightarrow x\\in_s v))\\to u\\doteq v\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Found}&amp;:=\\forall u\\bigl[(\\exists x(x\\in_s u))\\to\\exists x(x\\in_s u\\land\\forall z(z\\in_s x\\to\\neg(z\\in_s u)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pair}&amp;:=\\forall u\\forall v\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq u\\lor x\\doteq v)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Union}&amp;:=\\forall u\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in_s u\\land x\\in_s y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl(\\exists z\\forall x(x\\in_s z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in_s a\\land\\varphi))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[((\\forall x\\in_s a)\\exists y\\varphi)\\to\\exists b(\\forall x\\in_s a)(\\exists y\\in_s b)\\varphi\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[(\\exists x\\varphi)\\to\\exists x(\\varphi\\land\\forall y(y\\in_s x\\to\\neg\\varphi[y/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inf}&amp;:=\\exists u\\bigl[\\exists e(\\forall z\\neg(z\\in_s e)\\land e\\in_s u)\\land\n(\\forall x\\in_s u)(\\exists y\\in_s u)\\forall z(z\\in_s y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in_s x\\lor z\\doteq x))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}^{-}&amp;:=\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{Found},\\mathsf{Pair},\\mathsf{Union}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,a,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,a,z\\}|=3,\\ \\{a,z\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,y,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4,\\ \\{a,b\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}&amp;:=\\mathsf{KP}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}_\\omega&amp;:=\\mathsf{KP}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Inf}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\\quad\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&amp;:=\\forall u\\forall v\\bigl[(\\forall x(x\\in_s u\\leftrightarrow x\\in_s v))\\to u\\doteq v\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Found}&amp;:=\\forall u\\bigl[(\\exists x(x\\in_s u))\\to\\exists x(x\\in_s u\\land\\forall z(z\\in_s x\\to\\neg(z\\in_s u)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pair}&amp;:=\\forall u\\forall v\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq u\\lor x\\doteq v)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Union}&amp;:=\\forall u\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in_s u\\land x\\in_s y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl(\\exists z\\forall x(x\\in_s z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in_s a\\land\\varphi))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[((\\forall x\\in_s a)\\exists y\\varphi)\\to\\exists b(\\forall x\\in_s a)(\\exists y\\in_s b)\\varphi\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y)&amp;:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[(\\exists x\\varphi)\\to\\exists x(\\varphi\\land\\forall y(y\\in_s x\\to\\neg\\varphi[y/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inf}&amp;:=\\exists u\\bigl[\\exists e(\\forall z\\neg(z\\in_s e)\\land e\\in_s u)\\land\n(\\forall x\\in_s u)(\\exists y\\in_s u)\\forall z(z\\in_s y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in_s x\\lor z\\doteq x))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}^{-}&amp;:=\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{Found},\\mathsf{Pair},\\mathsf{Union}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,a,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,a,z\\}|=3,\\ \\{a,z\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,y,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4,\\ \\{a,b\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}&amp;:=\\mathsf{KP}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}_\\omega&amp;:=\\mathsf{KP}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Inf}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格沿用本章约定：KP 没有无穷公理，KPω 才加入 Inf；否则“ω 是 admissible”会与定义冲突。所有模式的参数都由 ucl 封闭，新鲜变量保证捕获避免部分代入合法。Found 是普通集合基础公理，Fnd 是全部公式的基础模式，两者没有混同。这里完整记录公理集合，未声称已给出 KP 的序数分析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-set-theory-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"676fecd09411613c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_\\in,\\Delta^s_0,\\operatorname{av}_s$、部分自由代入取 [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]]；$\\leftrightarrow$ 缩写 $(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)$。$\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)$ 按其有限自由变量指标递增作全称闭包。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_\\in,\\Delta^s_0,\\operatorname{av}_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x,y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ucl}_s(A)&:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\\quad\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j<k\\},\\ i_0<\\cdots<i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ext}&:=\\forall u\\forall v\\bigl[(\\forall x(x\\in_s u\\leftrightarrow x\\in_s v))\\to u\\doteq v\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Found}&:=\\forall u\\bigl[(\\exists x(x\\in_s u))\\to\\exists x(x\\in_s u\\land\\forall z(z\\in_s x\\to\\neg(z\\in_s u)))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Pair}&:=\\forall u\\forall v\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow(x\\doteq u\\lor x\\doteq v)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Union}&:=\\forall u\\exists w\\forall x(x\\in_s w\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in_s u\\land x\\in_s y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl(\\exists z\\forall x(x\\in_s z\\leftrightarrow(x\\in_s a\\land\\varphi))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[((\\forall x\\in_s a)\\exists y\\varphi)\\to\\exists b(\\forall x\\in_s a)(\\exists y\\in_s b)\\varphi\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y)&:=\\operatorname{ucl}_s\\bigl[(\\exists x\\varphi)\\to\\exists x(\\varphi\\land\\forall y(y\\in_s x\\to\\neg\\varphi[y/x]))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inf}&:=\\exists u\\bigl[\\exists e(\\forall z\\neg(z\\in_s e)\\land e\\in_s u)\\land\n(\\forall x\\in_s u)(\\exists y\\in_s u)\\forall z(z\\in_s y\\leftrightarrow(z\\in_s x\\lor z\\doteq x))\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}^{-}&:=\\{\\mathsf{Ext},\\mathsf{Found},\\mathsf{Pair},\\mathsf{Union}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Sep}(\\varphi;x,a,z):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,a,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,a,z\\}|=3,\\ \\{a,z\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\n\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Col}(\\varphi;x,y,a,b):\\varphi\\in\\Delta^s_0,\\ x,y,a,b\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |\\{x,y,a,b\\}|=4,\\ \\{a,b\\}\\cap\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}&:=\\mathsf{KP}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{Fnd}(\\varphi;x,y):\\varphi\\in\\mathcal F_\\in,\\ x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{av}_s(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{KP}_\\omega&:=\\mathsf{KP}\\cup\\{\\mathsf{Inf}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4005,"backlinks":[{"id":"550c278e32aba9e2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L_\\alpha$ 取 [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]]；$\\mathsf{KP},\\mathsf{KP}_\\omega$ 及 $\\models_s$ 取 [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] 的内部语法和实际集合结构语义。$\\alpha$ 为实际序数。"},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-498","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-493","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-th